WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.812
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Turn On, Log In and Shut Down.

2
00:00:06.112 --> 00:00:12.236
Start your computer safely and shut it down correctly. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:19.681
Step one. Press the power button once. Do not hold it down. Wait a few seconds for the screen to light up.

4
00:00:20.683 --> 00:00:27.379
Step two. Type your password and press Enter. Nobody should see your password, so cover the keyboard.

5
00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:34.289
Step three. The desktop appears. Click the Start button at the bottom left of the screen.

6
00:00:35.283 --> 00:00:42.246
Step four. Click Power, then choose Shut down. Never press the power button to turn off while Windows is working.

7
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.866
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:49.131
Turn on your computer and log in.

9
00:00:49.431 --> 00:00:50.838
Open the Start menu.

10
00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:54.090
Shut down the correct way, not with the power button.

11
00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.460
Well done!

